    {
      "q": "What does KBR Services sell to the government?",
      "a": "KBR Services sells primarily Facilities Support Services, which accounts for $512M in FY2026 to date. The company also provides Commercial and Industrial Machinery and Equipment (except Automotive and Electronic) Repair and Maintenance at $66.6M, Hotels (except Casino Hotels) and Motels at $15M, and Engineering Services at $7.8M."
